        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "an ATtiny-driven fan controller"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "If both MCUs are populated and enabled, their PB1 outputs can contend on PWM, causing unreliable fan control or stressing the output drivers. Shared reset and programming lines also prevent independent operation.",
